# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Line-ending policy
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository is hash-verified: manifest.json records a SHA-256 for every
# payload file, and tests/test_static_package.mjs fails when any byte differs.
# A checkout that rewrites line endings therefore breaks the integrity check.
#
# Windows Git commonly sets core.autocrlf=true, which would convert LF to CRLF
# on checkout and invalidate every recorded hash. Pinning `eol=lf` here makes the
# checkout byte-identical on every platform, regardless of the user's autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never convert these.
*.zip   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.ico   binary
*.pyc   binary
